{'symbol': 'CNP', 'date': '2023-01-03 16:15:00', 'title': 'CENTERPOINT ENERGY ANNOUNCES ORGANIZATIONAL CHANGES', 'text': "NEW STREAMLINED STRUCTURE SUPPORTS CONTINUED EXECUTION OF LONG-TERM GROWTH STRATEGY AND ADVANCES COMPANY'S SUCCESSION PLANNING EFFORTS HOUSTON, JAN. 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CENTERPOINT ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: CNP) TODAY ANNOUNCED ORGANIZATIONAL CHANGES DESIGNED TO FURTHER STRENGTHEN EXECUTION OF THE COMPANY'S LONG-TERM GROWTH STRATEGY, ITS SERVICE TO CUSTOMERS AND COMMUNITIES, VALUE-CREATION FOR STAKEHOLDERS, OPERATIONAL EFFICIENCIES, AND CORPORATE GOVERNANCE. THE STREAMLINED STRUCTURE, WHICH IS EFFECTIVE TODAY, BUILDS UPON THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED PROMOTION OF JASON WELLS TO PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER, EFFECTIVE JAN. 1, WITH DAVE LESAR CONTINUING TO SERVE AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER."}